WEBVTT

00:56:28.210 --> 00:56:32.238
or be retrained or take on something new,

00:56:32.262 --> 00:56:38.422
then people can fall
into depression and addictions

00:56:38.446 --> 00:56:40.706
and just use the money to do nothing.

00:56:41.053 --> 00:56:43.922
So I think we really need encouragement,

00:56:43.946 --> 00:56:45.491
because the main issue

00:56:45.515 --> 00:56:49.895
is with displaced workers not being able
to take on the new jobs

00:56:49.919 --> 00:56:51.339
that are being created.

00:56:51.363 --> 00:56:53.183
So applying the money,

00:56:53.207 --> 00:56:56.990
not to give everybody a peanut-butter
sum amount per month,

00:56:57.014 --> 00:57:00.847
but to encourage retraining is important.